/*
  ChargingSessionDetailWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0024 · ChargingSessionDetailWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `ChargingSessionDetailWidget` resolves (table "ChargingSessionDetailWidget")
  lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into
  the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept
  in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings
  without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/ChargingSessionDetailWidget.tsx) — the title, the four
  summary stats, the two chart series names, the compact unit caption, and the empty
  message. The charger group localizes the web `classifyCharger` literals (the web
  hardcodes them; native must resolve them through i18n). The remaining keys back
  the native-only chrome (registry description, unit symbols, freshness chip,
  refresh/retry/open, loading/error/no-telemetry copy, chart axis, a11y).
*/

